OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for junction improvement
OL,4,Ascheme approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn additional #6.6m of funding has been
OL,7,Fapproved to help pay for improvements
OL,8,Fat a busy Bradford junction.
OL,10,FCouncillors from across West Yorkshire
OL,11,Fagreed to release the extra cash to
OL,12,Ffund work at the intersection of Toller
OL,13,FLane, Whetley Hill, Whetley Lane and
OL,14,FCarlisle Road on Thursday.
OL,16,FThe decision by West Yorkshire Combined
OL,17,FAuthority's Investment Committee means
OL,18,Fthe total amount pledged towards the
OL,19,Fscheme stands at #8.56m.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
