OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for junction improvement
OL,4,Ascheme approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe works would include the creation of
OL,7,Fnew bus priority signals, eight
OL,8,Fpedestrian crossings, the closure of
OL,9,Fnearby Cross Road to traffic and the
OL,10,Fplanting of 54 trees.
